  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A choropleth map titled \"EPI: DPT-HepB-Hib 3 coverage by district - last month\" for December 2016, using the same districts and bands. Legend counts: Low 0-70 (6), Mid 70-80 (2), High 80-90 (3), Highest 90-100 (1), Invalid 100-1000 (0). Most of the northern and central districts are in the low band.",
